msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was finally able to return to the capital with Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To see my family again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫假设真能和米歇尔一起返回首都。⟪k:1⟫再次见到家人。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1DCBDA29_6825_4BF2_A6BD_F46E4A4F6E40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa0119dd59e770d4719decb29869c6ee7d3f02aa9c27006814e37d099c284cbf
